      "id": "claim_b09f128369e045f08e00a55514e80733",
      "statement": "Presence is runtime-only: an in-memory Map keyed by scopeKey:browserInstanceId, populated by browser_presence_announce (preserving connectedAt on re-announce, refreshing lastSeenAt via an injectable clock), filtered by socket OPEN, and deleted on socket close with no persistence.",
